@guide A_48_Felwood
@name Felwood (53-54)
@faction Alliance
@levels 53-54
@zone Felwood
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Felwood, visit 1 of 3 on the Alliance route, levels 53-54.
@next A_49_Winterspring

travel Felwood
accept 8461 Deadwood of the North | Nafien.
complete 8461 Deadwood of the North | Deadwood furbolgs in northern Felwood.
turnin 8461 Deadwood of the North
accept 8465 Speak to Salfa | Nafien. Turned in at the Winterspring end of the Timbermaw tunnel.
accept 4421 The Corruption of the Jadefire | Eridan Bluewind.
complete 4421 The Corruption of the Jadefire | Jadefire satyrs at Jadefire Glen.
turnin 4421 The Corruption of the Jadefire
accept 4906 Further Corruption
complete 4906 Further Corruption | Xavathras, Jadefire Glen.
turnin 4906 Further Corruption
accept 5156 Verifying the Corruption | Taronn Redfeather.
complete 5156 Verifying the Corruption | Explore the area north of Shatter Scar Vale.
turnin 5156 Verifying the Corruption
accept 5155 Forces of Jaedenar | Greta Mosshoof, Emerald Sanctuary.
complete 5155 Forces of Jaedenar | Jaedenar cultists.
turnin 5155 Forces of Jaedenar
accept 5157 Collection of the Corrupt Water
complete 5157 Collection of the Corrupt Water | Fill the vessel at the corrupted moonwell in Jaedenar.
turnin 5157 Collection of the Corrupt Water
fp Talonbranch Glade
accept 8460 Timbermaw Ally | Grazle, Timbermaw Hold area.
turnin 8460 Timbermaw Ally
accept 4101 Cleansing Felwood | Arathandris Silversky.
accept 8462 Speak to Nafien
complete 4101 Cleansing Felwood | Cenarion Plant Salve - gather from Felwood.
turnin 4101 Cleansing Felwood
turnin 8462 Speak to Nafien
accept 5882 Salve via Hunting | Arathandris Silversky. Needs Cleansing Felwood turned in.
complete 5882 Salve via Hunting | Corrupted Soul Shards from Cursed Oozes in the Ruins of Constellas, west of the road.
turnin 5882 Salve via Hunting
level 54 | Winterspring starts at 54. If you are lower, kill what is around you here (or run a dungeon) until you reach it.
